!
! This test calculates the NMR spin-spin couplings in the water molecule
! The no-pair approach is used, so that we calculate the DSO term via the
! Sternheimer approximation. The same calculation can then also be done
! via the RELCCSD code and serves as an extra check.
! Note that we consistently leave out the SS integrals.
!
!  Three Hamiltonians have been tested: DC (Dirac-Coulomb)
!                                       BSS+MFSSO and BSS.
!
!
!    Hamilt/Property  HO isotr    HO anisotr    HH isotr    HH anisotr
!     =====================================================================
!            BSS      -73.7193     35.5615      -8.5605     40.8995
!       BSS+MFSSO     -73.7173     35.5588      -8.5897     40.9064 
!           DC        -73.6700     35.5249      -8.5794     40.9047
!
!
!
